{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼國一日分為四分，若盡一分則打鼓為節，此謂四分中初打鼓時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊譯云寺"}
{"id": null, "n": "0917010", "target": null, "type": "orig", "text": "三藏＋（法師）【三】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0917010", "target": null, "type": "mod", "text": "三藏【大】，三藏法師【宋】【元】【明】【宮】"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "K08n0082_p0994a06"}
